A battery of electromotive force (e.m.f.) $8.0\text{ V}$ and negligible internal resistance is connected to a thermistor, a switch $X$ and two fixed resistors, as shown in Fig. 6.2.
{{figure:figure_6_2}}
Resistor $R_1$ has resistance $6.0\text{ k}\Omega$ and resistor $R_2$ has resistance $4.0\text{ k}\Omega$.
